+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+Tool definitions declare the input shape that model calls must satisfy before reaching an executor.
+
+## Validation
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` checks input against the resolved tool definition's `inputSchema` before calling the executor; invalid input returns a result describing the validation failure and does not invoke the executor ([validated by: returns a required-field validation result without invoking the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4)).
